ng_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment5:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment5","raw_text":" 出车对自己棋形的缺陷认识不足，应马八进七正常出子较好。","text":" 出车对自己棋形的缺陷认识不足，应马八进七正常出子较好。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":5,"anchor_node_id":"0:5","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment6:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment6","raw_text":" 冲3卒没有必要，应改走卒7进1，兵三进一，车1平7，黑方满意。","text":" 冲3卒没有必要，应改走卒7进1，兵三进一，车1平7，黑方满意。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":6,"anchor_node_id":"0:6","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment10:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment10","raw_text":" 出双横车准备伺机邀兑红车。","text":" 出双横车准备伺机邀兑红车。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment13","raw_text":" 冲兵缓着，应马八进七出动大子较好。","text":" 冲兵缓着，应马八进七出动大子较好。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment14","raw_text":" 平车邀兑好棋，从此黑方反先。","text":" 平车邀兑好棋，从此黑方反先。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"0:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":" 同样是防止黑车6进7打相、压马，应士四进五少受利用。","text":" 同样是防止黑车6进7打相、压马，应士四进五少受利用。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":" 先手打乱红方阵形并占据要津，一个字——爽！","text":" 先手打乱红方阵形并占据要津，一个字——爽！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment21","raw_text":" 阻止黑马迅速出击。","text":" 阻止黑马迅速出击。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"0:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment24","raw_text":" 跳马方向不够准确，可车1平4盯住红拐脚马，容易控制局势。","text":" 跳马方向不够准确，可车1平4盯住红拐脚马，容易控制局势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":" 红趁机纠缠住黑方。","text":" 红趁机纠缠住黑方。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment28","raw_text":" 弃卒是局部巧手！如车4进7，兵七平八，红方有多兵之利。","text":" 弃卒是局部巧手！如车4进7，兵七平八，红方有多兵之利。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment31","raw_text":" 献马希望收到兑子争先的效果。","text":" 献马希望收到兑子争先的效果。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"0:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment32","raw_text":" 吃马有将计就计之意，另有象1进3吃兵互相牵制的选择。","text":" 吃马有将计就计之意，另有象1进3吃兵互相牵制的选择。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment33","raw_text":" 红车先手出动，形势有利。","text":" 红车先手出动，形势有利。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"0:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment36:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment36","raw_text":" 现在的形势可能是黑方当初所期望的，古谱上很多杀局都是从这种双车马布置上演的。|| 其实黑双车虽呈“二鬼拍门”之势，但在红方的森严守卫下，难以出棋。以后红方应付得当，黑方后援不继反而难以自拔。所以黑方前面的构思有凶悍有余、精确不足之嫌。","text":" 现在的形势可能是黑方当初所期望的，古谱上很多杀局都是从这种双车马布置上演的。\n 其实黑双车虽呈“二鬼拍门”之势，但在红方的森严守卫下，难以出棋。以后红方应付得当，黑方后援不继反而难以自拔。所以黑方前面的构思有凶悍有余、精确不足之嫌。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":36,"anchor_node_id":"0:36","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":" 进炮叫将急于求成，可改走兵一进一，黑双车马进退两难。","text":" 进炮叫将急于求成，可改走兵一进一，黑双车马进退两难。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment39:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment39","raw_text":" 平兵以为捉死马大漏着！对这种古谱上习见的杀形出现疏忽只因“贪”字当头！","text":" 平兵以为捉死马大漏着！对这种古谱上习见的杀形出现疏忽只因“贪”字当头！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":39,"anchor_node_id":"0:39","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment45:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment45","raw_text":" 如相五退三，车4平8，炮二平六，车8退2，虽能解杀但败局难挽。","text":" 如相五退三，车4平8，炮二平六，车8退2，虽能解杀但败局难挽。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":45,"anchor_node_id":"0:45","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment48:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment48","raw_text":"黑胜","text":"黑胜","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":48,"anchor_node_id":"0:48","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["窦国柱 先负 林弈仙"],"DhtmlXQ_event":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":[""],"DhtmlXQ_place":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":[""],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["窦国柱"],"DhtmlXQ_redteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["林弈仙"],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["黑胜"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["E03 仙人指路对中炮"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_author":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":39,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":48,"legal_move_records":48,"annotations":20,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":20}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-59","category_id":"59","title":"第三部分 各地名手实战对局 窦国柱 负 林弈仙","catalogue_order":266,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-59-12.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-59"]}}
